      "slug": "bamboo-bar",
      "term": "Bamboo bar",
      "definition": "A dc worked into the row below (into the front loop of the stitch two rows down), pulling the loop up to the current row height. This creates a raised vertical bar on the fabric surface."
    },
    {
      "slug": "turning-chain",
      "term": "Turning chain",
      "definition": "One chain at the start of each row. Does not count as a stitch."
    },
